  "summary": "Bill Ackman argues that successful value investing requires buying resilient companies at a deep discount to their intrinsic value, protected by wide moats such as strong brands, predictable cash flows, and operational systems. This discipline allows investors to capitalize on market overreactions to temporary disruptions or technological scares.",
  "topics": [
